eratorname{cos}⁡3t & 0 & -\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t \\\\ -\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t & 0 & -\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =[\\text{ }\\left|\\begin{aligned}0 & -\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t \\\\ 0 & -\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,i-\\left|\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t & -\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t \\\\ -\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t & -\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,j+\\left|\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t & 0 \\\\ -\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t & 0\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,k\\text{ }] \\\\  & =⟨0-0,-(-{cos}^{2}⁡3t-{sin}^{2}⁡3t),0-0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,1,0⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373429 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373430 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373429 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373431 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373429 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373432 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373429 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373433 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373429 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373434 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373429 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373429 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373429 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186373434 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373429 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "171888e5-1a2e-5e52-943a-a78ce9e763ca" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373430 #edb/ref 1080 "⟨1,0,0⟩" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373430 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373430 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "4cb47bec-7a6f-5792-ba0d-6e5b38af9aa6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373431 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}⟨1,1,-1⟩" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373431 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373431 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "ff3b30d0-baff-5a1e-9320-438cb3a67392" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373432 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{3}⟨2\\sqrt{2},0,-1⟩" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373432 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373432 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "d8339d83-7333-5325-a4b4-f881c4722e4b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373433 #edb/ref 1080 "⟨-1,0,0⟩" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373433 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373433 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "80068700-acdb-51cb-9ca8-4590c1407d03" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373434 #edb/ref 1080 "⟨0,1,0⟩" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373434 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373434 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1ecd40c2-7430-5053-981f-1c864376a6aa" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373435 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186373436 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373435 #edb/ref 1069 "q-99583" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373435 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373435 #edb/ref 1071 "Find the binormal vector to the curve $r(t)$ at an arbitrary point, given that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(t) & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5{e}^{2t}+1}}⟨2{e}^{t},{e}^{t},1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that $T$ denotes the unit tangent vector." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373435 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "28b318e9-60c2-5e57-acb1-0cc92a2b71d1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373435 #edb/ref 1074 "The binormal vector is given by\n\n$$\nB(t)=T(t)\\times N(t),\n$$\n\nwhere the principal normal vector $N(t)$ is given by\n\n$$\nN(t)=\\frac{{T}^{′}(t)}{‖{T}^{′}(t)‖}.\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the principal normal $N(t).$ To do this, we calculate ${T}^{′}(t)$ and its magnitude as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{T}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{2{e}^{t}}{\\sqrt{5{e}^{2t}+1}}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{{e}^{t}}{\\sqrt{5{e}^{2t}+1}}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5{e}^{2t}+1}})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{2{e}^{t}}{(5{e}^{2t}+1)^{3/2}},\\,\\frac{{e}^{t}}{(5{e}^{2t}+1)^{3/2}},\\,-\\frac{5{e}^{2t}}{(5{e}^{2t}+1)^{3/2}}⟩ \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{(5{e}^{2t}+1)^{3/2}}⟨2{e}^{t},\\,{e}^{t},\\,-5{e}^{2t}⟩ \\\\ ‖{T}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\frac{1}{(5{e}^{2t}+1)^{3/2}}\\sqrt{(2{e}^{t})^{2}+{({e}^{t})}^{2}+{(-5{e}^{2t})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{(5{e}^{2t}+1)^{3/2}}\\sqrt{4{e}^{2t}+{e}^{2t}+25{e}^{4t}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{5}{e}^{t}}{(5{e}^{2t}+1)^{3/2}}\\sqrt{1+5{e}^{2t}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{5}{e}^{t}}{5{e}^{2t}+1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we normalize ${T}^{′}(t)$ and obtain the principal normal to the curve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}N(t) & =\\frac{{T}^{′}(t)}{‖{T}^{′}(t)‖}=\\frac{\\frac{1}{(5{e}^{2t}+1)^{3/2}}⟨2{e}^{t},\\,{e}^{t},\\,-5{e}^{2t}⟩}{(\\frac{\\sqrt{5}{e}^{t}}{5{e}^{2t}+1})}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}\\sqrt{5{e}^{2t}+1}}⟨2,\\,1,\\,-5{e}^{t}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the binormal vector, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B(t) & =T(t)\\times N(t) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5{e}^{2t}+1}}⟨2{e}^{t},{e}^{t},1⟩\\times \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}\\sqrt{5{e}^{2t}+1}}⟨2,\\,1,\\,-5{e}^{t}⟩ \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}(5{e}^{2t}+1)}\\,\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 2{e}^{t} & {e}^{t} & 1 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -5{e}^{t}\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}(5{e}^{2t}+1)}[\\text{ }\\left|\\begin{aligned}{e}^{t} & 1 \\\\ 1 & -5{e}^{t}\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,i-\\left|\\begin{aligned}2{e}^{t} & 1 \\\\ 2 & -5{e}^{t}\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,j+\\left|\\begin{aligned}2{e}^{t} & {e}^{t} \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,k\\text{ }] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}(5{e}^{2t}+1)}⟨-5{e}^{2t}-1,-(-10{e}^{2t}-2),2{e}^{t}-2{e}^{t}⟩ \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}(5{e}^{2t}+1)}⟨-(5{e}^{2t}+1),\\,2(5{e}^{2t}+1),\\,0⟩ \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}⟨-1,2,0⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373436 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373437 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373436 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373438 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373436 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373439 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373436 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373440 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373436 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373441 #edb/ref 1759218604